01:00:33.750 --> 01:00:52.210
Glenn Gore (Affinidi Pte Ltd): you can't send messages to each other because there's no compatible crypto algorithm on either side. So, if you want to plug in, we have a wide support of DID methods, but within the DID method, you must have an ED25519 key, in the DID document. So that one is a hard…

